{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act46side_level_act46side_08_end","storyGroup":"act46side","storySort":18,"storyDependence":"act46side_level_act46side_08_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"OS-8","storyName":"宣告在途","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"恩希欧迪斯辞去喀兰贸易的职务，诺希斯代表喀兰贸易停止与维多利亚的所有合作。卡罗琳交出情报后险些被维多利亚灭口，所幸梅兰德基金会将其救下。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act46side/level_act46side_08_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act46side_08","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":16,"next":18,"characters":["诺希斯","恩希欧迪斯","喀兰贸易员工","轻浮的谢拉格守卫","不耐烦的谢拉格守卫","谨慎的谢拉格守卫","阿德颂","谢拉格守卫","卡罗琳","维多利亚特工","梅兰德基金会特工"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_bg_45_g11_karlanheadquarters.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$drift_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_drift_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":8},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":10},{"type":"text","text":"空空荡荡的办公室。","id":11},{"type":"dialog","id":12},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":13},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":14},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":15},{"type":"text","text":"诺希斯并不熟悉这种感觉，他走近办公桌，桌上杯子里，新倒的咖啡冒着热气，下方压着一张有恩希欧迪斯签名的文件。","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"“委任状”。","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#2$1","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"不在公司里告别吗……","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":21},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":22},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":23},{"type":"charslot","id":24},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"1","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","id":25},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#2$1","id":26},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1","id":27},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-60,0","duration":"0","block":"true","id":28},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"60,0","duration":"0","block":"true","id":29},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"false","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":30},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":31},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"……文件已经签好了。","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"你明白这么做的风险。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"矿产和土地密不可分，我们绕过蔓珠院，直接与外国合资建设矿区。","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"未来会有很多麻烦。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"如果不在今天付出这些，拉近差距，未来他们只会索要更多。","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"所以，这已是我们能接受的最低代价。","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"你的结论未免有些乐观，恩希欧迪斯。","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"无论对任何事，你从不像我这般乐观。","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"这意味着很多时候，你能比我走得更远。","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"……","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"没有你的那点“乐观”帮忙，我也不会有黑暗中迈出一步的信心。","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"哼哼。","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"很久没有听到你恭维什么人了。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"去完成后面的计划吧，诺希斯。","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"……","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":61},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":62},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":63},{"type":"charslot","id":64},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":65},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"1","fadetime":"0","keep":"false","id":66},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_bg_45_g11_karlanheadquarters.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":67},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":68},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":69},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":70,"musicid":1},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":71},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1161_1#1$1","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"喀兰贸易员工","text":"中层以上的员工都到齐了，录像也随时可以开始。","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_1161_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"直接开始吧。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":76},{"type":"dialog","id":77},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_devicebeep","id":78},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":79},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1161_1#1$1","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"喀兰贸易员工","text":"好的，总监，这次公开会议的内容是？","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_1161_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"今日召集大家，是要宣布一项重大的人事变动。","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#2$1","id":84},{"type":"dialog","id":85},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":86},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#7$1","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"即日起，恩希欧迪斯·希瓦艾什，将不再担任喀兰贸易的董事长与首席执行官。","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"由于近期的业务事故，恩希欧迪斯引咎辞职，董事会已经批准了他的请求。","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"同时经董事会决议，本人将接任恩希欧迪斯的全部职务。","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"由此，我谨代表董事会，向各位同事与谢拉格民众发表喀兰贸易新时期的第一份声明。","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#2$1","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"……","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#7$1","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"喀兰贸易将终止和维多利亚方面的一切合作。","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"而过去由恩希欧迪斯一意孤行签订的诸多协议，全部暂时搁置，等待董事会做出进一步判断。","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"诺希斯","text":"在如此特殊的时刻，我呼吁各位同事坚守岗位，以谢拉格的发展为重，扫清各类遗留的问题。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_206_gnosis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#2$1","id":101},{"type":"multiline","name":"诺希斯","text":"……","id":102},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_206_gnosis_1#7$1","id":103},{"type":"multiline","name":"诺希斯","text":"谢拉格需要我们。","id":104},{"type":"dialog","id":105},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":106},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":107},{"type":"charslot","id":108},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_bg_bg_cellroomA.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":109},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":110},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":111},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":112},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_283_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","block":"false","id":113},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_284_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","block":"true","id":114},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":115},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_283_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"轻浮的谢拉格守卫","text":"醒醒，我俩来换班了。","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_npc_283_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":118},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_286_1#1$1","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"不耐烦的谢拉格守卫","text":"……真慢。","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_286_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":121},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_283_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_284_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"轻浮的谢拉格守卫","text":"这不头一回来，还要找地方呢。","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"轻浮的谢拉格守卫","text":"这活儿麻烦吗？","id":125},{"type":"charslot","id":126},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_286_1#1$1","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"不耐烦的谢拉格守卫","text":"别人都不说话，你管管那个领头的老不死就行。","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_286_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":129},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_283_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":130},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_284_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"轻浮的谢拉格守卫","text":"哪一个？","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"轻浮的谢拉格守卫","text":"蔓珠院有谁不是老不死吗？","id":133},{"type":"charslot","id":134},{"type":"text","text":"众人听完哄堂大笑，随后散去，只留下两个值班的守卫。","id":135},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_283_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":136},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_284_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谨慎的谢拉格守卫","text":"……说话留点余地，你也是谢拉格人，怎么能对长老出言不逊？","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_284_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_283_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"轻浮的谢拉格守卫","text":"你还为他说话啊？这帮*谢拉格俚语*把我们祸害成这样——","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_npc_283_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_284_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谨慎的谢拉格守卫","text":"住嘴，不要命啦？","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_284_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":143},{"type":"text","text":"两名守卫不约而同地看向端坐在牢房内的阿德颂长老，他专心于手边厚重的典籍，捻起书页一角，若有所思。","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_283_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":145},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_284_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谨慎的谢拉格守卫","text":"还好，还好。","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_284_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_283_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"轻浮的谢拉格守卫","text":"……有什么好怕的，夸夸其谈了几百年，蔓珠院还能翻天了不成？","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_npc_283_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_284_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谨慎的谢拉格守卫","text":"他们是耶拉冈德的代行者，你不尊重长老也应该尊重祂。","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_284_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_283_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"轻浮的谢拉格守卫","text":"我就这个脾气，再说了蔓珠院也配得到尊重？","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_npc_283_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"轻浮的谢拉格守卫","text":"我母亲生病的时候，修士摘了点草喂给她，让我对着草祈祷，硬说能带来耶拉冈德的庇护。","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_npc_283_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"轻浮的谢拉格守卫","text":"最后去找喀兰贸易的医生，他和我说，病情给修士耽误成这样，哪怕晚一天都救不回来。","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_npc_283_1$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"轻浮的谢拉格守卫","text":"要说代行者，也该是恩希欧迪斯大人！","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_npc_283_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":158},{"type":"dialog","id":159},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#7$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":160},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"……“文士名唤尤尔根，事祂热忱，多行善事。尝有恶徒嫉恨，诬其盗取府库银币，不日将就戮。”","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_npc_1998_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"“尤尔根手足被重锁束缚，夜闻兵丁刀剑相击，知死期将至，内心忧苦。”","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_npc_1998_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":164},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_283_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_284_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谨慎的谢拉格守卫","text":"这是……","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_284_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_283_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"轻浮的谢拉格守卫","text":"嗐，看来我知道是哪个老不死了。","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_npc_283_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":170},{"type":"dialog","id":171},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":172},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_ironhitone","channel":"1","id":173},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_ironhitone","channel":"2","delay":"0.3","id":174},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_ironhitone","channel":"3","delay":"0.6","id":175},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":176},{"type":"text","text":"守卫提起警棍，径直走近阿德颂的监牢，重重敲向铁栏。阿德颂停下诵念，平静地看着他。","id":177},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_283_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"轻浮的谢拉格守卫","text":"喂，老不死的，进了笼子就给我闭嘴。","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_npc_283_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"轻浮的谢拉格守卫","text":"想想这辈子造的孽，见了耶拉冈德后还不还得上。","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_npc_283_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"……","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_npc_1998_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"“尤尔根仰望亦不见光亮，枉然狱中，跪于草席，向祂哀告……”","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1998_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"“公义的耶拉冈德啊，我难道没有奉你的名施善、奉你的名求道吗？”","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1998_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"“难道你的国，只使正直人罹难，而使不义人得救？”","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1998_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"“执法律的人，为何听那荒渺的假誓？我所救过的人，为何沉默不语？”","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1998_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":189},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2.5","id":190},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_284_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":191},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谨慎的谢拉格守卫","text":"……","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_284_1$1.png"},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":194,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_283_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":195},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.4","xstrength":"40","ystrength":"50","vibrato":"60","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"轻浮的谢拉格守卫","text":"*谢拉格俚语*，叛徒也敢觍着脸说这话？！","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_npc_283_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"轻浮的谢拉格守卫","text":"今天非得好好教训你——","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_npc_283_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":199},{"type":"dialog","id":200},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_key","id":201},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":202},{"type":"text","text":"他把警棍架在一边，取出钥匙想要打开牢门，愤怒使他右手发抖，插了几次都对不准锁孔。","id":203},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"……“耶拉冈德啊！我的身陷入囹圄，而我的灵仍在求你的垂怜。”","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_avg_npc_1998_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"“趁我的眼目能视，我的耳朵能听，向我伸出公义的手吧！”","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_avg_npc_1998_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":207},{"type":"dialog","id":208},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_dooropen","id":209},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.4","xstrength":"70","ystrength":"70","vibrato":"70","randomness":"95","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":210},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":211},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#8$1","id":212},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_283_1#1$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"0,0","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","block":"true","id":213},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":214},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":215},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_283_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"轻浮的谢拉格守卫","text":"我保证，今天是你的手最后一次翻开《耶拉冈德》！","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_npc_283_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":218},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":219},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-100,0","duration":"1","block":"true","id":220},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":221},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_stickimp","id":222},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":223},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.2","block":"true","id":224},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.2","block":"true","id":225},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":226},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_283_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":227},{"type":"shake","name":"right","power":"20","times":"70","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":228},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":229},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown3","id":230},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":231},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_283_1#1$1","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"-100,-100","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","block":"true","id":232},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":233},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":234},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"-100,-100","posto":"-100,0","duration":"0","block":"true","id":235},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":236},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":237},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_284_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":238},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":239},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":240},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_284_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谨慎的谢拉格守卫","text":"……","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_284_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":243},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":244,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","block":"true","id":246},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":247},{"type":"shake","name":"right","power":"10","times":"70","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谨慎的谢拉格守卫","text":"我，我做了什么……","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谨慎的谢拉格守卫","text":"我伤害了我的同僚……","id":250},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"你做得很好，孩子。","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1998_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"神圣的重担，不止被交给三族，或是圣女和蔓珠院。","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1998_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"任何谢拉格人，都应当时刻践行祂的意志。","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1998_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"一如方才。","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1998_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_284_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谨慎的谢拉格守卫","text":"我记得……“聆悔者尤尔根”。","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_284_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谨慎的谢拉格守卫","text":"小时候，我在雪山中迷路，即将昏迷的时候，是一位修士救了我。","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_284_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谨慎的谢拉格守卫","text":"在驮兽上，他解下自己的衣袍，紧紧裹住我，讲了尤尔根的故事，说耶拉冈德必将拯救每一位无辜的子民……","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_284_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"孩子，其他修士关押在哪？","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1998_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_284_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谨慎的谢拉格守卫","text":"都在这附近。","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_284_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"寻找时机，将他们都放出来，让他们分散奔逃，保住自己的性命。","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1998_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"战争正在雪山中酝酿，而蔓珠院会在废墟上建起一切。","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_npc_1998_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"我会为你讲述“聆悔者尤尔根”的结局。","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1998_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":271},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":272},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":273},{"type":"charslot","id":274},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_bg_30_ex1_snowmount_s.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":275},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":276},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":277},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_285_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","block":"true","id":278},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢拉格守卫","text":"站住！","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_npc_285_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢拉格守卫","text":"大长老，不要逼我。我们都带着武器，不会放任何人离开这里！","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_npc_285_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"……我会走过你的身边。","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_npc_1998_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"若你一定要用弓弩僭越神明的意，瞄准你自己的心，那就试一试吧。","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1998_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_285_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢拉格守卫","text":"你……","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_npc_285_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":288},{"type":"dialog","id":289},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowrun","channel":"sr","id":290},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_283_1#1$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-40,0","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","block":"false","id":291},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_283_1#1$1","posfrom":"250,0","posto":"100,0","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","block":"true","id":292},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sr","fadetime":"0.5","id":293},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":294},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_swordstone","id":295},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-40,0","posto":"-160,0","duration":"1","block":"false","id":296},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"100,0","posto":"200,0","duration":"1","block":"true","id":297},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":298},{"type":"charslot","id":299},{"type":"text","text":"闻讯赶来的守卫们列成两队，面面相觑。更多的人选择收起武器，让开了一条狭长的通道。","id":300},{"type":"dialog","id":301},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#1$1","id":302},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":303},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowbootwalk","id":304},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#7$1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":305},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":306},{"type":"charslot","id":307},{"type":"text","text":"阿德颂垂下头颅，从守卫中走过，在雪地留下浅浅的印痕。","id":308},{"type":"text","text":"……","id":309},{"type":"dialog","id":310},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":311},{"type":"dialog","id":312},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":313},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":314},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":315},{"type":"charslot","id":316},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_bg_67_G10_kjeragwilde_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":317},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":318},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“尤尔根话音刚落，整座监牢开始摇撼，风雪钻进监牢的每个缝隙。”","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":319},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“囚禁信徒的墙垣竟如朽烂的乔木，碎为粉尘细屑，令那不容目视的强光笼在信徒的身。”","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":320},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“兵丁们四处跌倒，武器折断，而他们的身体却未损分毫。他们匍匐在尤尔根的脚边，泫然流涕，向他忏悔着罪过。”","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":321},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“‘聆悔者尤尔根’，足迹踏遍三族领土，终身宣讲这一奇事。”","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":322},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“如是，耶拉冈德向呼唤之人伸出手，行了祂的义。”","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":323},{"type":"subtitle","id":324},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":325},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":326},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wind","volume":"0.5","loop":"true","channel":"wind2","id":327},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":328},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowbootwalk","id":329},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1999_1#2$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":330},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":331},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1999_1#2$1","focus":"none","id":332},{"type":"text","text":"关节渐渐失去知觉，鞋子一次次陷入松软的雪地，她不停迈着腿，大口吸入冰冷的空气。","id":333},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1999_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡罗琳","text":"呵——呵——","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_1999_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":336},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":337},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1999_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":338},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":339},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1999_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡罗琳","text":"……谁，呵……","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_1999_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":342},{"type":"dialog","id":343},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_bg_67_G10_kjeragwilde_n.png","xScale":"1.5","yScale":"1.5","fadetime":"1.5","screenadapt":"coverall","id":344},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":345},{"type":"backgroundtween","xFrom":"0","xTo":"-100","duration":"40","block":"false","id":346},{"type":"text","text":"远方隐约出现了人影，正向她而来，但她的眼前金星忽闪，已然无法辨认。","id":347},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":348},{"type":"dialog","id":349},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_bg_67_G10_kjeragwilde_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"1","id":350},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":351},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1999_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡罗琳","text":"你们……","id":353,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_1999_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":354},{"type":"charslot","id":355},{"type":"dialog","id":356},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowrun","id":357},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_248","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","block":"false","id":358},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_241","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","block":"true","id":359},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":360},{"type":"charslot","id":361},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_399_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":362},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚特工","text":"卡罗琳女士，我们奉命过来接应你。","id":364,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_399_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚特工","text":"按理说，应该有人与你一起出来才对。","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_399_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1999_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡罗琳","text":"……","id":367,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_1999_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1999_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡罗琳","text":"他们被谢拉格人抓住了。","id":369,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_npc_1999_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_399_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚特工","text":"那，情报没有问题吧？","id":371,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_399_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1999_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡罗琳","text":"……你可以去通知公爵阁下，隐藏在谢拉格背后的力量消失不见了。","id":373,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_npc_1999_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡罗琳","text":"我观测并记录了某次天外来物的坠地，随之而来的天灾也进一步验证了我的判断。","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_npc_1999_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡罗琳","text":"无论能量场说，还是巨兽假说，都可以解释谢拉格发生的变化。","id":375,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_npc_1999_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡罗琳","text":"带走这个文件夹，我关于谢拉格的几种假说的研究都在里面了，你可以——","id":376,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_npc_1999_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":377},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_gunequip","id":378},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":379},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1999_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡罗琳","text":"……啊？！","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_1999_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_399_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚特工","text":"很遗憾，卡罗琳女士。","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_399_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚特工","text":"你应该不会认为，自己私下偷偷联络梅兰德基金会的事，能瞒到现在吧？","id":384,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_399_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚特工","text":"所以，公爵阁下只让我们带回资料。","id":385,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_399_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚特工","text":"我相信谢拉格失去庇护这件事会让她满意的。","id":386,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_399_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1999_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡罗琳","text":"你们——","id":388,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_1999_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1999_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":389},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡罗琳","text":"……","id":390,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_1999_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1999_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡罗琳","text":"天外来客、巨兽传说……","id":392,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1999_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1999_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡罗琳","text":"我看到的这片大地，处处都是尚未揭晓真相的奇迹。","id":394,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_1999_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1999_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡罗琳","text":"但你们的眼睛里，只装得下欺诈、盗窃与谋杀，除此之外，一切不过粪土。","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_1999_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1999_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":397},{"type":"multiline","name":"卡罗琳","text":"要不是为了从谢拉格脱身……","id":398},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"40","ystrength":"40","vibrato":"60","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":399},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1999_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":400},{"type":"multiline","name":"卡罗琳","text":"我怎么会和你们这种人待在一起！","id":401},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_399_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":402},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚特工","text":"你的投诉，我会如实提交给公爵阁下的。","id":403,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_399_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚特工","text":"再见了，卡罗琳女士，感谢你对国家的“服务”。","id":404,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_399_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":405},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_atk_arrowload_n","id":406},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":407},{"type":"charslot","id":408},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1999_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":409},{"type":"text","text":"她深深地叹了一口气，不知道在为谁而惋惜。","id":410},{"type":"charslot","id":411},{"type":"dialog","id":412},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"0.5","id":413},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"wind2","fadetime":"0.5","id":414},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":415},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_smoke_grenade","id":416},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":417},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":418},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":419},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":420},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$tense_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_tense_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":421,"musicid":4},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_399_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚特工","text":"烟雾弹？！","id":423,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_399_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":424},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":425},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":426},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.01","block":"true","id":427},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_arrow_rain","volume":"1","channel":"1","id":428},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":429},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.01","block":"true","id":430},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_explo_n","volume":"1","channel":"2","id":431},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":432},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.01","block":"true","id":433},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":434},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":435},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_399_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":436},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"50","ystrength":"50","vibrato":"60","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚特工","text":"敌袭！就近分散寻找掩护！","id":438,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_399_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":439},{"type":"charslot","id":440},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":441},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":442},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.01","block":"true","id":443},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_arrow_rain","volume":"1","channel":"1","id":444},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":445},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.01","block":"true","id":446},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_explo_n","volume":"1","channel":"2","id":447},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":448},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.01","block":"true","id":449},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":450},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":451},{"type":"text","text":"夜色笼罩的灰烟和铳炮声，让雪地一片混沌。","id":452},{"type":"dialog","id":453},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_carspeedup","id":454},{"type":"delay","time":"4","id":455},{"type":"text","text":"直到一辆黑色的越野车，从浓烟中冲出。而它身后，陆陆续续出来的维多利亚的特工们，徒劳地向逐渐开远的车辆射击。","id":456},{"type":"dialog","id":457},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":458},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":459},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":460},{"type":"charslot","id":461},{"type":"bgeffect","id":462},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0","fillto":"0.2","grad":"true","fadetime":"0","id":463},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0","fillto":"0.2","grad":"true","fadetime":"0","id":464},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":465},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$newhope01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_newhope01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":466,"musicid":5},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_driveincar","volume":"0.4","loop":"true","channel":"car","id":467},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1999_1#5$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":468},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":469},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":470},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1999_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":471},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":472},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅兰德基金会特工","text":"让你担惊受怕了，卡罗琳女士。","id":473,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅兰德基金会特工","text":"为了避免被维多利亚的人发现，我们花了不少时间。","id":474,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅兰德基金会特工","text":"东西都没有落下吧？","id":475,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1999_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":476},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡罗琳","text":"……","id":477,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_1999_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":478},{"type":"text","text":"她垂下头，从带出来的资料里，拿出标注着天外来物的那个文件夹，递给了坐在前排的特工。","id":479},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1999_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":480},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":481},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡罗琳","text":"……我什么时候可以开始研究？","id":482,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_npc_1999_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":483},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅兰德基金会特工","text":"不要着急，女士，我的上峰想先和你谈谈，他对你的课题很感兴趣。","id":484,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅兰德基金会特工","text":"相信你会和我们相处很长一段时间。","id":485,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":486},{"type":"text","text":"卡罗琳点点头，突然想起来了什么。","id":487},{"type":"text","text":"本要交给维多利亚的“谢拉格报告”，还没来得及递给对方。","id":488},{"type":"dialog","id":489},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_carwindow","id":490},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":491},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wind","id":492},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.2","fillto":"0","grad":"true","fadetime":"3","id":493},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.2","fillto":"0","grad":"true","fadetime":"3","id":494},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":495},{"type":"text","text":"她打开车窗，任凭寒风涌入，一张张地抽出在谢拉格费尽心血写下的论文，毫不犹豫地往外抛去。","id":496},{"type":"dialog","id":497},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper1","channel":"7","id":498},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper1","channel":"8","delay":"0.5","id":499},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper1","channel":"9","delay":"1","id":500},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":501},{"type":"text","text":"夜色下的纸张更显洁白，像新雪降生于荒野。","id":502},{"type":"text","text":"它们在风雪中旋转，也在政客掀起的漩涡中旋转。","id":503},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡罗琳","text":"还给你了，维多利亚。","id":504},{"type":"dialog","id":505},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":506},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":507},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"car","fadetime":"0.5","id":508},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":509},{"type":"image","id":510},{"type":"charslot","id":511}],"characters":["诺希斯","恩希欧迪斯","喀兰贸易员工","轻浮的谢拉格守卫","不耐烦的谢拉格守卫","谨慎的谢拉格守卫","阿德颂","谢拉格守卫","卡罗琳","维多利亚特工","梅兰德基金会特工"]}